    "_note": "Lighter claims built on a core class (SPEC §0.1, RR-14). A profile names its base class and the base checks it doesn't apply, because its conditions make them vacuous; trace-lint R8 checks each excluded id is a check of the base class. Presets bundle a base with extension classes and safe defaults; a host card MAY name one in `preset` (informative to visitors; it changes no wire behaviour).",
